{"speciesId":249,"names":{"fr":"Lugia","es":"Lugia","en":"Lugia","ja":"ルギア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is said that it quietly spends its time deep at the bottom of the sea because its powers are too strong."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It has an incred­ ible ability to calm raging sto­ rms. It is said that LUGIA appears when storms start."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LUGIA’s wings pack devastating power - a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart regular houses. As a result, this POKéMON chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LUGIA’s wings pack devastating power - a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart regular houses. As a result, this POKéMON chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"LUGIA is so powerful even a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart houses. As a result, it chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is said that it quietly spends its time deep at the bottom of the sea because its powers are too strong."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is said that it quietly spends its time deep at the